          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[01:05] Recall:</strong> What was the military codename of the surprise Israeli pre-emptive air strike launched at 07:45 on the morning of 5 June 1967?</li><li><strong>[02:30] Explain:</strong> Explain how the destruction of over 300 Egyptian combat aircraft on the ground in the first three hours decided the entire outcome of the Six-Day War.</li><li><strong>[03:50] Challenge:</strong> By 10 June 1967, Israel had captured territories three times its original size. How did this astonishing victory transform Israel from a vulnerable state into an occupying power with complex demographic problems?</li></ol>",
