              "hinge_question": "Why did Kissinger prevent Israel from destroying the encircled Egyptian Third Army at the end of the war?",
              "source_context": "Kissinger realized that total Israeli humiliation of Egypt would make peace negotiations impossible. He deliberately restrained Israel from annihilating the trapped Third Army and pressured both sides into UN Resolution 338. Kissinger then launched months of 'shuttle diplomacy' flying between Jerusalem, Cairo, and Damascus to negotiate troop disengagement pacts. **Hinge Question:** Why did Kissinger prevent Israel from destroying the encircled Egyptian Third Army at the end of the war?",
