              "enquiry_question": "What was Henry Kissinger's primary diplomatic goal during the 1973 negotiations shown in Source E?",
              "model_answer": "Kissinger aimed to broker a ceasefire where neither side achieved total victory, allowing the US to replace Soviet influence in Cairo and guide Egypt toward direct negotiations with Israel.",
