          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[00:20] Recall:</strong> In what month and year did Egyptian President Anwar Sadat make his historic flight to Jerusalem to address the Israeli parliament?</li><li><strong>[00:45] Explain:</strong> Why was Sadat's decision to travel directly to Jerusalem described as an unprecedented psychological earthquake in Middle Eastern diplomacy?</li><li><strong>[00:55] Challenge:</strong> How did Sadat's direct, televised appeal to the Israeli public break down thirty years of profound fear, mutual suspicion, and diplomatic intransigence?</li></ol>",
