          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[02:10] Recall:</strong> Which Israeli Prime Minister welcomed President Anwar Sadat onto the tarmac at Ben Gurion Airport in November 1977?</li><li><strong>[04:20] Explain:</strong> What extreme security fears gripped Israeli military commanders as Sadat's Boeing 707 approached the runway, fearing an ambush?</li><li><strong>[06:15] Challenge:</strong> Evaluate the emotional power of eyewitness oral history: how did ordinary citizens on both sides experience the surreal transformation of a mortal enemy into an architect of peace?</li></ol>",
