          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[01:00] Recall:</strong> In which overcrowded refugee camp in the Gaza Strip did the fatal traffic collision occur on 8 December 1987 that ignited the First Intifada?</li><li><strong>[02:15] Explain:</strong> What deep-seated political, economic, and social grievances had accumulated over twenty years of Israeli military occupation to make the uprising inevitable?</li><li><strong>[03:30] Challenge:</strong> What does the Arabic word <em>Intifada</em> literally mean, and how did Palestinian youths armed with stones challenging Israeli tanks transform global perceptions of the conflict?</li></ol>",
