          "teacher_guidance": "Historic primary source footage of PLO Chairman Yasser Arafat addressing the UN General Assembly in New York, establishing the PLO's international diplomatic legitimacy. Recommended Watch Window: 02:00–06:30 • Lesson Phase: Primary Source & Diplomatic Analysis. Tone Alert: Historic primary footage of Yasser Arafat addressing the UN General Assembly wearing a holster.",
