          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[01:10] Recall:</strong> Which United States President stood between Yitzhak Rabin and Yasser Arafat as they exchanged their historic handshake on the White House lawn on 13 September 1993?</li><li><strong>[02:15] Explain:</strong> What fundamental mutual recognition was agreed between the State of Israel and the Palestine Liberation Organization (PLO) in the Letters of Mutual Recognition preceding Oslo I?</li><li><strong>[03:20] Challenge:</strong> Analyze the body language of Yitzhak Rabin during the handshake: why did his initial hesitation reveal the profound political gamble he was taking with a skeptical Israeli electorate?</li></ol>",
